      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسرأت</span></b> , said of a female locust, [and app. of
a female of the lizard called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَبّ</span>, and a fish, and
the like, (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرْءٌ</span>,)] <i>She attained the period of
laying eggs.</i> (S, K.)

